=== 1. S -- the spread of the cycle-30 estimator family for c0 ===
  joint 17-rung K=6, basis [eps^-2 + poly6]  -1.633394698e-15
  joint 17-rung K=6 + eps^-1 in basis        -1.585179e-15
  joint 17-rung K=5                          -1.927230284e-15
  six c30 rungs alone, K=3                   -1.623411826e-15
  six c30 rungs alone, K=2                   -1.64820725e-15
  1-D max-residual scan                      -1.639822722e-15
  full range incl. the LOO-REJECTED K=5 : S_all = 3.4205128e-16
  full range of the ACCEPTED family     : S     = 6.302825e-17

=== 2. B -- model-truncation bias of the PROPOSED design, from seen data ===
  method: take the corrected 17-rung data, fit a HIGHER-order plain polynomial (K=8) to it,
  use that as a synthetic truth, evaluate it at the six proposed eps, then run the GRADED
  estimator (six rungs alone, basis [eps^-2, 1, eps, eps^2, eps^3]) on the synthetic values.
  Truth has c0 == 0 exactly, so whatever c0 comes back is pure truncation/conditioning bias.
    synth K=6 -> graded fit K=2 : c0_bias = -3.7558201e-20
    synth K=6 -> graded fit K=3 : c0_bias = -2.1055624e-24
    synth K=7 -> graded fit K=2 : c0_bias = -3.7590184e-20
    synth K=7 -> graded fit K=3 : c0_bias = -2.1840305e-24
    synth K=8 -> graded fit K=2 : c0_bias = -3.7563679e-20
    synth K=8 -> graded fit K=3 : c0_bias = -2.0687293e-24
    synth K=9 -> graded fit K=2 : c0_bias = -3.746944e-20
    synth K=9 -> graded fit K=3 : c0_bias = -1.3858734e-24
  B = max |c0_bias| over the 8 synthetic/graded combinations = 3.7590184e-20

=== 3. THE MECHANICAL TOLERANCE RULE (stated before any new rung is solved) ===
  T1 := 3 * max(S, B).   S = the correction's own estimator spread; B = the design's
  truncation bias.  A correction cannot be held to a standard finer than either.
  S = 6.302825e-17 ; B = 3.7590184e-20 ; T1 = 1.8908475e-16
  ALTERNATIVE HYPOTHESIS (a_operative is right, no correction needed) predicts
  c0_new = 1.633394698e-15 .  Discrimination margin = |delta_a| / T1 = 8.63843
  PRE-STATED ABORT: if the margin is < 10 the test is UNDERPOWERED and is reported as such
  instead of graded.   margin >= 10 ? NO

